{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026n1WYKUr7H11790815347.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中聯辦和外交部駐港特派員公署，早上舉行國慶日升旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">儀式早上約七時，在中聯辦辦公大樓前舉行，五星紅旗在國歌聲中徐徐升起，中聯辦主任周霽、副主任羅永綱等出席，肅立並向國旗行注目禮致敬。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20265tAKaMvfXI1790815355.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，外交部駐港特派員公署亦舉行升旗禮。駐港特派員崔建春與工作人員出席，現場奏唱國歌。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SXIzSwJOZB1790815368.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mSiGH4M1WJ1790815381.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG.LIAISON-0800_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T00:59:36.751109+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}